# Per-tool skill roots fanned out by scripts/link-skills.sh at setup time.
# The canonical source is skills/; only .claude/skills is committed (so Claude
# Code, including cloud/Cowork, works on a fresh clone). These are symlinks
# rebuilt on demand -- never commit them.
